<h1>Privacy Policy for BiCalc</h1>
<p class="updated">Last updated: September 1, 2026</p>

<p>
This Privacy Policy explains how the <strong>BiCalc</strong> application ("the App") collects, uses, and protects user information. BiCalc is developed and maintained by <strong>PT Tifa Pratama Jaya</strong>. By downloading and using this App, you agree to the practices described in this policy.
</p>

<h2>1. About the App</h2>
<p>
BiCalc is a simple calculator application that displays calculation results both as numbers and as their spoken form in Wos Byak (the local language of the Biak-Numfor people of Papua, Indonesia). The App is designed to support the learning and preservation of this local language while providing standard calculator functionality.
</p>

<h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
<p>BiCalc is designed to work without requiring account registration and does not directly request personal data from users. However, some data may be collected automatically as described below:</p>

<h3>a. Calculation Data</h3>
<p>Numbers and calculation results you enter are processed <strong>locally on your device</strong> and are <strong>not transmitted, stored, or shared</strong> with our servers or any third party.</p>

<h3>b. Data from Advertising Services (Google AdMob)</h3>
<p>This App displays banner ads through <strong>Google AdMob</strong>. To serve ads, including relevant/personalized ads, AdMob may collect data such as:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Device identifiers (Advertising ID / GAID)</li>
  <li>General device information (model, operating system, language)</li>
  <li>Approximate location data (based on IP address)</li>
  <li>Ad interaction data (clicks, impressions)</li>
</ul>
<p>Data collection by AdMob is governed by Google's own privacy policies. You can learn more and manage your ad preferences through the following links:</p>
<ul>
  <li><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank">Google Privacy Policy</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank">How Google Uses Advertising Data</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a></li>
</ul>

