  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Advertising ID &amp; ad data (via AdMob)</td>
    <td>Displaying banner ads within the App, including personalization based on your device's ad settings</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<h2>4. Sharing Data with Third Parties</h2>
<p>
We do not sell, rent, or trade user data. The only third party that receives data related to your use of the App is <strong>Google AdMob</strong>, solely for the purpose of serving advertisements as described in Section 2b.
</p>

<h2>5. Data Storage</h2>
<p>
App settings such as your selected color theme are stored locally on your device using the app's internal storage and are not transmitted to any server.
</p>

<h2>6. Children's Privacy</h2>
<p>
BiCalc is not specifically directed at children under the age of 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal data from children. If you are a parent or guardian and believe your child has provided us with personal data, please contact us using the details below so that such data can be removed.
</p>

<h2>7. Data Security</h2>
<p>
We take reasonable technical measures to protect the security of the App. However, no method of electronic transmission or storage is 100% secure.
</p>

<h2>8. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
<p>
This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page along with the updated "last updated" date. We encourage you to review this page periodically.
</p>

